ided source code located in the <code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate=
"><span class=3D"pre">app_e310</span></code>, <code class=3D"docutils liter=
al notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">app_e200</span></code>, or <code class=
=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">app_e316</span></code=
> folders within the cloned repository</p>
<p data-imt-p=3D"1">Open the vitis software and locate the <strong>antsdrxx=
x.sdk</strong> directory</p>
