7188" height=3D"364.375"></p>
<p data-imt-p=3D"1">First, you need to create a hardware platform based on =
the exported .xsa file.</p>
<p><img alt=3D"image-20230207130651797" src=3D"https://antsdr-docs.micropha=
se.cn/en/latest/_images/image-20230207130651797.png" width=3D"696.4375" hei=
ght=3D"538.2604370117188"></p>
<p><img alt=3D"image-20230207130938975" src=3D"https://antsdr-docs.micropha=
