se.cn/en/latest/_images/image-20230207131141754.png" width=3D"696.4375" hei=
ght=3D"532.1979370117188"></p>
<p data-imt-p=3D"1">Then copy the contents of <code class=3D"docutils liter=
al notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">app_e200</span></code>, <code class=3D"=
docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">app_e310</span></code>, o=
r <code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">app_e316=
</span></code> from the repository into the current <code class=3D"docutils=
 literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">src</span></code> folder, and the=
n click Compile to generate an executable program.</p>
<p><img alt=3D"image-20230207131326326" src=3D"https://antsdr-docs.micropha=
se.cn/en/latest/_images/image-20230207131326326.png" width=3D"497" height=
